    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_garbage:gar_dramm_novice_start_312#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_garbage",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_garbage.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 111,
      "string_id": "gar_dramm_novice_start_312",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "That's interesting, thanks.",
      "JA_current": "そりゃおもしろい。ありがとよ。",
      "JA_new": "面白い話だな。ありがとう。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "gar_dramm_novice_start",
          "phrase_id": "312",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_garbage.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_garbage:gar_dramm_novice_start_3111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_garbage",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_garbage.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 105,
      "string_id": "gar_dramm_novice_start_3111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "To the right, by the marshes, there's a secret hiding place. You'll see a metallic construction overhanging a puddle. My stash is right below it...I put it there a while ago but you saved my life and you probably need it more than I do anyway. So feel free to use it.",
      "JA_current": "沼地の右手に秘密の隠し場所がある。俺の隠し場所は沼に突き出た鉄骨の右下だ。…結構長く隠してたんだが、アンタは命の恩人だし俺が使うより有益だろうから中身は勝手に持っていっていいよ。",
      "JA_new": "沼地の右手に、秘密の隠し場所がある。水たまりにせり出した金属の構造物が見えるはずだ。その真下に俺の隠し物がある……前から置いてたが、あんたは命を救ってくれたし、俺より必要だろう。遠慮なく使ってくれ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "gar_dramm_novice_start",
          "phrase_id": "3111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_garbage.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_garbage:gar_dramm_novice_start_31111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_garbage",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_garbage.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 108,
      "string_id": "gar_dramm_novice_start_31111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Thanks man, that's useful info.",
      "JA_current": "ありがとよ。有用な情報だ。",
      "JA_new": "ありがとう。助かる情報だ。",
